{"seq":1,"slug":"experiment-overlap-detect","title":"实验互斥/流量冲突检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/experiment-flag-orchestration/dependency-conflict/experiment-overlap-detect","wordCount":3007,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"实验互斥-流量冲突检测\">实验互斥/流量冲突检测</h1><p>一个搜索团队同时跑着三个实验：排序模型 A/B、结果卡片样式 A/B、以及一个把首屏广告位下移 20% 的布局实验。三份周报都说各自指标有正向提升，其中布局实验的提升尤为显著。两周后有人发现，布局实验里&quot;对照组&quot;的用户在 60% 的情况下同时被排序实验处理过——两个实验的效果互相污染，三份结论没有一份是干净的。</p>\n<p>这不是统计方法的失败，而是<strong>流量分配层面的事故</strong>。三个实验各自的分流逻辑都正确，问题出在没有任何一层去检查&quot;这三个实验会不会抢同一批用户、以及抢到了会不会互相影响&quot;。这一篇要建立的就是这一层检查，它的核心矛盾非常具体：为了拿到干净的因果结论，互相影响的实验必须互斥；但互斥组越大，能被并行运行的实验就越少，而实验吞吐量本身就是平台的核心效率指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"冲突的四种含义\">冲突的四种含义</h3><p>先把概念分清，因为&quot;冲突&quot;这个词在这个上下文里被用来指至少三件不同的事：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>冲突类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>危害</th>\n<th>检测时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>流量相交</td>\n<td>两个实验的用户集合有非空交集</td>\n<td>单独看无害，是可并行的前提</td>\n<td>静态（声明期）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>效果干扰</td>\n<td>相交的用户在两个实验中，一个实验的处理改变了另一个的效果</td>\n<td>结论污染（假阳性/假阴性）</td>\n<td>静态（需人工标注）+ 事后观测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分流权重超发</td>\n<td>同一分层内各实验流量之和超过该层容量</td>\n<td>部分用户无法入组或入组不稳定</td>\n<td>静态（可计算）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源冲突</td>\n<td>两个实验改同一份配置/同一个开关</td>\n<td>后写覆盖先写，行为不确定</td>\n<td>静态（资源锁求交）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一类与第三类是纯粹的可计算问题，第二类需要业务判断，第四类在 <a href=\"../dependency-conflict/config-dependency-graph\">配置/开关依赖图</a> 中详述。本篇聚焦前两类在本实验域内的处理，并给出统一的分层模型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  U[全量用户请求] --&gt; H0[&quot;分桶哈希&lt;br/&gt;hash(shard_salt, unit_id)&quot;]&#10;  H0 --&gt; L1[&quot;层 A:搜索质量&lt;br/&gt;容量 100%&quot;]&#10;  H0 --&gt; L2[&quot;层 B:页面布局&lt;br/&gt;容量 100%&quot;]&#10;  H0 --&gt; L3[&quot;层 C:商业化&lt;br/&gt;容量 60%&quot;]&#10;  L1 --&gt; E1[&quot;exp_ranking_q3&lt;br/&gt;50%&quot;]&#10;  L1 --&gt; E2[&quot;exp_rerank_v2&lt;br/&gt;30%&quot;]&#10;  L3 --&gt; E3[&quot;exp_ad_slot&lt;br/&gt;20%&quot;]&#10;  E1 -.互斥组-.-&gt; E2&#10;  L2 -.互斥组-.-&gt; E3\">graph TD\n  U[全量用户请求] --&gt; H0[\"分桶哈希&lt;br/&gt;hash(shard_salt, unit_id)\"]\n  H0 --&gt; L1[\"层 A:搜索质量&lt;br/&gt;容量 100%\"]\n  H0 --&gt; L2[\"层 B:页面布局&lt;br/&gt;容量 100%\"]\n  H0 --&gt; L3[\"层 C:商业化&lt;br/&gt;容量 60%\"]\n  L1 --&gt; E1[\"exp_ranking_q3&lt;br/&gt;50%\"]\n  L1 --&gt; E2[\"exp_rerank_v2&lt;br/&gt;30%\"]\n  L3 --&gt; E3[\"exp_ad_slot&lt;br/&gt;20%\"]\n  E1 -.互斥组-.-&gt; E2\n  L2 -.互斥组-.-&gt; E3</pre><h2 id=\"分层正交-让实验可以并行\">分层正交：让实验可以并行</h2><h3 id=\"每层独立-salt\">每层独立 salt</h3><p>解决&quot;既要并行又要干净&quot;的标准手段是<strong>分层正交（layered orthogonal assignment）</strong>。核心思想是：把用户在不同层上独立地分桶，从而让&quot;层 A 的对照组&quot;和&quot;层 B 的实验组&quot;在统计上相互独立——一个用户被 A 层分到哪一桶，与他被 B 层分到哪一桶无关。</p>\n<p>实现上只需要<strong>每层用不同的 salt</strong>：<code>bucket = hash(layer_salt + &quot;|&quot; + unit_id) mod 10000</code>。不同 salt 下哈希的均匀性独立，于是各层的桶分配近似独立；同一层内不同实验通过划分互不重叠的桶区间来实现互斥。这样&quot;A 层的实验1 vs 对照&quot;和&quot;B 层的实验2 vs 对照&quot;可以同时进行，且互相不污染——只要这两个实验在<strong>语义上</strong>确实不互相影响。</p>\n<h3 id=\"正交不等于无干扰\">正交不等于无干扰</h3><p>正交性有一个必须记住的前提：<strong>它保证的是统计独立，不保证没有业务干扰。</strong> 布局实验把广告位下移 20%，这会改变用户看到的搜索结果位置分布，从而影响排序实验的点击指标——两个实验在各自的层里分桶独立，但在因果上并不独立。所以分层正交只解决了&quot;可以并行&quot;的一半问题，&quot;是否互相影响&quot;仍然需要人标注。平台能做的是把这个标注变成一次性的知识：每个实验在创建时声明自己影响哪些业务信号（如&quot;曝光位置&quot;、&quot;请求延迟&quot;），两个实验的影响信号集合相交时被标为潜在干扰，需要人工确认。</p>\n<h2 id=\"互斥组与并行度预算\">互斥组与并行度预算</h2><p>业务上的硬约束（&quot;这两个实验绝对不能同时作用于一个用户&quot;）用**互斥组（mutex group）**表达。同一个互斥组内的实验，其用户集合必须互不相交。</p>\n<h3 id=\"交叠的度量\">交叠的度量</h3><p>在讨论互斥之前，需要先把&quot;两个实验抢同一批用户&quot;量化。设实验 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的入组用户集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⊆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_i \\subseteq \\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span> 为全体可入组用户），其流量占比为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i = |U_i| / |\\Omega|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣/∣Ω∣</span></span></span></span></span>。两个实验的<strong>交叠率</strong>定义为交集占并集的比例：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J(U_a, U_b) = \\frac{|U_a \\cap U_b|}{|U_a \\cup U_b|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Jaccard 系数的好处是它对两个实验的规模差异不敏感——一个 50% 的实验和一个 1% 的实验，若 1% 完全落在 50% 之内，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.02</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J = 0.02</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.02</span></span></span></span></span>，看起来很小，但实际含义是&quot;这 1% 的用户 100% 被污染了&quot;。因此判定用的第二个量是<strong>条件覆盖率</strong>，即小集合被大集合吞掉的比例：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(U_a, U_b) = \\frac{|U_a \\cap U_b|}{\\min(|U_a|, |U_b|)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>判定的组合规则是：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 超过阈值（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>）时判为 <code>warning</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 且两实验在同一分层且语义相关时判为 <code>blocking</code>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span> 则用于排序——同样触发告警的两对实验，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span> 更大的一对占用更多共同流量，应优先处理。</p>\n<p>工程上这两个量都不需要真的求集合。分层模型下每个实验的入组集合是桶区间的并集，因此交叠退化成区间交的长度之和：把两边的桶区间按左端点归并扫描一次即可，复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k \\log k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为区间数），无需遍历用户。这就是为什么冲突检测能在提交时同步完成，而不是靠离线跑一次用户集合 join。</p>\n<h3 id=\"互斥的代价\">互斥的代价</h3><p>互斥是昂贵的，代价可以被精确计算。设互斥组内有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个实验，各自需要流量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1, p_2, \\dots, p_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（相对全量用户的占比），则该组对用户的占用是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i=1}^{n} p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，它必须 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。更关键的是<strong>并行度</strong>：如果一组实验必须互斥，那么在任意时刻只有一个实验能拿到足够的流量，组内实验只能串行推进——这让本该两周完成的三个实验变成六周。</p>\n<p>因此互斥组的设计原则是<strong>尽量小、尽量晚</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>小</strong>：只在确有业务干扰时建组，而不是&quot;同一个团队做的实验就放一组&quot;（后者是把管理上的便利伪装成技术约束）。</li>\n<li><strong>晚</strong>：建组是创建实验时的一个显式动作，而不是默认行为；默认是分层正交而非互斥。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个实践上有效的折中是<strong>部分互斥</strong>：让两个实验在 90% 的流量上互斥、在 10% 上共享，用一个专门的&quot;共享桶&quot;来测量两个实验同时作用时的交互效应。这既保证了主结论的干净（90% 的那部分），又给出了一份额外的交互效应数据。代价是分析复杂度的上升，通常只在确实关心交互时才采用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>并行度</th>\n<th>结论干净度</th>\n<th>分析复杂度</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完全互斥</td>\n<td>低（组内串行）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>强业务干扰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层正交</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>依赖影响信号标注</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>无业务干扰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分互斥 + 共享桶</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>主结论干净</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>需要量化交互效应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>串行（先后跑）</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>强交互且不关心交互大小</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"权重超发的检测与修复\">权重超发的检测与修复</h2><h3 id=\"提交时判定\">提交时判定</h3><p>同一层内所有实验的流量之和不能超过该层容量。超过时会发生什么取决于实现，而这两种结果都不可接受：如果分流器按比例截断，后来的实验会静默地拿不到它声明的流量（周报里的样本量与预期不符）；如果不截断而让区间重叠，就会有用户同时落入两个实验，两个实验的结论都失效。</p>\n<p>检测是一次简单的区间求和，但它必须发生在<strong>提交时</strong>而不是运行时——运行时的检测意味着问题已经生效。判定算法是：对每一层收集该层全部活跃实验的桶区间，检查是否两两不重叠，总和是否 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span></span></span></span></span> 层容量。更实用的判据是把层容量的一部分留作<strong>预留池</strong>（如 10%），因为实验的流量调整总会发生，预留池让调整不需要重新分配已入组用户。</p>\n<h3 id=\"比例调整的语义\">比例调整的语义</h3><p>这里有一个容易忽略的细节：<strong>调整活跃实验的比例必须保证已入组用户不被重分。</strong> 如果用户在实验比例从 10% 调到 30% 时被重新分桶，那么原本在对照组的用户可能被移到实验组，他的后续行为无法归因。正确语义是&quot;比例调整只影响新入组用户，已入组用户保持原分配&quot;，或者更严格地&quot;比例只可扩大且新纳入的用户从新增区间取&quot;。这条语义直接决定了第 3 章 <a href=\"../rollout-orchestration/staged-rollout-plan\">分阶段灰度计划编排</a> 里&quot;实验类变更的阶段推进&quot;为什么与开关类不同——开关的比例调整是幂等的重新求值，实验的比例调整是有历史的分配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把冲突变成可执行的数据\">把冲突变成可执行的数据</h2><h3 id=\"冲突记录的结构\">冲突记录的结构</h3><p>检测到冲突之后，输出的结构决定了后面能做什么。一个只输出 <code>{ conflict: true }</code> 的检测器是无用的——它既不能排序也不能给建议。输出应当是一份<strong>冲突记录</strong>，每条包含：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;conflict_id&quot;: &quot;cf_01J8Z...&quot;,&#10;  &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;traffic_overlap&quot;,&#10;  &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;blocking&quot;,&#10;  &quot;parties&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;item_id&quot;: &quot;it_a&quot;, &quot;change_id&quot;: &quot;cr_1&quot;, &quot;layer&quot;: &quot;search_quality&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;item_id&quot;: &quot;it_b&quot;, &quot;change_id&quot;: &quot;cr_2&quot;, &quot;layer&quot;: &quot;search_quality&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;evidence&quot;: { &quot;overlap_buckets&quot;: 1200, &quot;overlap_ratio&quot;: 0.12 },&#10;  &quot;detected_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T04:12:00+08:00&quot;,&#10;  &quot;suggestions&quot;: [&quot;move_it_b_to_layer_B&quot;, &quot;make_mutex_group&quot;, &quot;serialize&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"conflict_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cf_01J8Z...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"traffic_overlap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"severity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"blocking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"parties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"item_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"it_a\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"change_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cr_1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"layer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"search_quality\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"item_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"it_b\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"change_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cr_2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"layer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"search_quality\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"overlap_buckets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"overlap_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"detected_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T04:12:00+08:00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"suggestions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"move_it_b_to_layer_B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"make_mutex_group\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"serialize\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"严重度与候选解法\">严重度与候选解法</h3><p><code>severity</code> 的三档（<code>blocking</code> / <code>warning</code> / <code>info</code>）是让编排层决定&quot;拒绝提交&quot;还是&quot;提示但放行&quot;的开关：<code>blocking</code> 用于权重超发与硬互斥违反，<code>warning</code> 用于潜在干扰（影响信号相交但未标注互斥），<code>info</code> 用于纯提示（如同一 owner 的多个实验高度重叠，可能只是重复实验）。<code>evidence</code> 必须给量化证据，因为&quot;12% 的用户重叠&quot;和&quot;0.01% 的重叠&quot;在处理优先级上完全不同，而一个布尔量无法区分它们。</p>\n<p><code>suggestions</code> 是这份记录真正产生价值的地方：它把冲突从&quot;问题报告&quot;变成&quot;待选方案&quot;。三条默认建议对应上表里的三种解法（换层、建互斥组、串行），编排层可以据此自动执行低风险的修复（换层通常是无损的），并把需要人决策的部分（建互斥组会降低并行度）升级给人。<a href=\"../dependency-conflict/change-conflict-resolve\">冲突提示与解决建议</a> 会把这套建议机制推广到全部冲突类型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>冲突有四类：流量相交（可计算、通常无害）、效果干扰（需业务标注）、权重超发（可计算、必须阻塞）、资源冲突（走依赖图）。</li>\n<li>分层正交通过&quot;每层不同 salt&quot;保证统计独立，从而让实验并行；但它<strong>不保证业务干扰不存在</strong>，干扰需要用影响信号标注来兜住。</li>\n<li>互斥组表达硬约束，代价是可精确定量的并行度损失；原则是&quot;尽量小、尽量晚&quot;，默认正交而非默认互斥。</li>\n<li>权重超发必须在提交时检测（运行时检测等于已经生效）；层内保留预留池，比例调整必须保证已入组用户不被重分。</li>\n<li>检测输出必须是结构化的冲突记录：严重度分档、量化证据、候选解法。布尔量输出无法支撑任何后续编排。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本篇文章判定出的冲突会被 <a href=\"../dependency-conflict/change-conflict-resolve\">冲突提示与解决建议</a> 归一并生成行动建议，它的&quot;依赖顺序&quot;输出是 <a href=\"../rollout-orchestration/staged-rollout-plan\">分阶段灰度计划编排</a> 划分阶段的输入；实验这类变更对象的结构定义见 <a href=\"../unified-change-model/flag-experiment-config-unify\">开关/实验/配置统一抽象</a>，而实验分流本身的统计方法论属于 <a href=\"../../../global-ecommerce/search-experiment-platform/\">搜索实验平台与 A/B 系统工程</a> 的范围，本篇不重复。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"实验互斥/流量冲突检测","id":"实验互斥-流量冲突检测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"冲突的四种含义","id":"冲突的四种含义"},{"level":2,"text":"分层正交：让实验可以并行","id":"分层正交-让实验可以并行"},{"level":3,"text":"每层独立 salt","id":"每层独立-salt"},{"level":3,"text":"正交不等于无干扰","id":"正交不等于无干扰"},{"level":2,"text":"互斥组与并行度预算","id":"互斥组与并行度预算"},{"level":3,"text":"交叠的度量","id":"交叠的度量"},{"level":3,"text":"互斥的代价","id":"互斥的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"权重超发的检测与修复","id":"权重超发的检测与修复"},{"level":3,"text":"提交时判定","id":"提交时判定"},{"level":3,"text":"比例调整的语义","id":"比例调整的语义"},{"level":2,"text":"把冲突变成可执行的数据","id":"把冲突变成可执行的数据"},{"level":3,"text":"冲突记录的结构","id":"冲突记录的结构"},{"level":3,"text":"严重度与候选解法","id":"严重度与候选解法"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"变更 owner 与审批流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/experiment-flag-orchestration/unified-change-model/change-owner-approval"},"next":{"title":"配置/开关依赖图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/experiment-flag-orchestration/dependency-conflict/config-dependency-graph"}}